    "3e42135f6082": {
      "text": "32吨轨道式集装箱龙门起重机出口俄罗斯案例：Q355E耐低温钢、-40℃稳定运行、俄语本地化、全面安全防护与运输保护，提供完整可靠的集装箱搬运解决方案。",
      "translation": "Case study: a 32-ton Rail-Mounted Container Gantry Crane exported to Russia—Q355E low-temperature steel, stable operation at -40°C, Russian localization, comprehensive safety and transport protection, delivering a complete and reliable container-handling solution.",
      "status": "approved",
