    },
    "67057d69250f": {
      "text": "获取定制化起重机解决方案和报价",
      "translation": "Get a Customized Crane Solution and Quote",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "27e859afbeb0": {
      "text": "填写您的详细资料，我们将在24小时内给您答复!",
      "translation": "Fill in your details and we will reply to you within 24 hours!",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "9e5b86263b55": {
      "text": "该项目涉及一台32吨的发动机 轨道式集装箱龙门起重机，该设备出口俄罗斯，主要用于集装箱的装卸和转运作业。",
      "translation": "This project involved a 32-ton Rail-Mounted Container Gantry Crane exported to Russia, used primarily for loading, unloading, and transferring containers.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "1b56a209139a": {
      "text": "考虑到当地气候极其寒冷，主体结构采用Q355E耐低温钢材制造。",
      "translation": "Given the extremely cold local climate, the main structure is fabricated from Q355E low-temperature-resistant steel.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "d2dab9a30999": {
      "text": "电气系统经过特殊设计，具备抗寒性能，并配备了完善的安全保护系统，可在-40℃至+40℃的环境温度范围内稳定运行。",
      "translation": "The electrical system was specially engineered for cold resistance and equipped with a comprehensive safety protection system, enabling stable operation across an ambient temperature range of -40℃ to +40℃.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "5524c860ff45": {
      "text": "俄罗斯客户的核心要求不仅仅是\"购买一台能够吊装集装箱的龙门起重机\"，而是要获得一个完整可靠的解决方案，该方案能够在极低温度环境下稳定运行，减少停机时间，并适应当地的操作系统。",
      "translation": "The Russian customer's core requirement was not simply to \"buy a gantry crane capable of lifting containers,\" but to obtain a complete, reliable solution—one that could operate stably in an extremely low-temperature environment, minimize downtime, and adapt to local operating systems.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "c90d2e63d0bf": {
      "text": "客户的需求和要求包括：",
      "translation": "The customer's needs and requirements included:",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "e24c2a0a0572": {
      "text": "人们担心设备在-40°C的低温下可能会冻结、变脆或无法启动。",
      "translation": "There were concerns that the equipment might freeze, become brittle, or fail to start at -40°C.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "678747f1f217": {
      "text": "因此，需要一种能够在-40°C环境下可靠运行的轨道式集装箱龙门起重机，以便在俄罗斯寒冷地区长期户外使用。",
      "translation": "A Rail-Mounted Container Gantry Crane capable of reliable operation at -40°C was therefore required, for long-term outdoor use in Russia's cold regions.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "36b8c12381ca": {
      "text": "考虑到与当地操作习惯和电气标准不匹配可能会影响运行和维护，控制系统需要配备俄语标识并符合当地供电标准，以便更便捷高效地进行操作和管理。",
      "translation": "Because a mismatch with local operating habits and electrical standards could affect operation and maintenance, the control system needed Russian-language labeling and compliance with local power-supply standards, for more convenient and efficient operation and management.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "37c063e5b34e": {
      "text": "长期运行过程中存在安全风险和潜在故障，因此需要一套全面的安全保护系统。",
      "translation": "Safety risks and potential faults exist over long-term operation, so a comprehensive safety protection system was required.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "80d49998771e": {
      "text": "考虑到长途运输过程中关键部件可能受损，从而影响安装调试，因此需要可靠的包装解决方案来确保安全交付。",
      "translation": "Because critical components could be damaged during long-distance transport, affecting installation and commissioning, a reliable packaging solution was needed to ensure safe delivery.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "a46fcc45bede": {
      "text": "基于这些考虑，我们开发了一种完全针对性的系统设计和封装解决方案。",
      "translation": "Based on these considerations, we developed a fully targeted system design and packaging solution.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "036023333e0b": {
      "text": "为确保在俄罗斯-40°C的低温环境下可靠运行，采用了专门的低温设计：",
      "translation": "To ensure reliable operation in Russia's -40°C low-temperature environment, a dedicated low-temperature design was adopted:",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "7312f5892910": {
      "text": "**Q355E 低温钢**：主体结构采用 Q355E 钢板，在 -40°C 时仍保持优异的冲击韧性，有效防止脆性断裂，确保在寒冷环境下安全可靠运行。",
      "translation": "**Q355E low-temperature steel**: The main structure uses Q355E steel plate, which retains excellent impact toughness at -40°C, effectively preventing brittle fracture and ensuring safe, reliable operation in cold environments.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "26c7c4c51594": {
      "text": "**耐低温电缆**：整台起重机采用耐低温电缆，在寒冷条件下仍能保持柔韧性和绝缘性能，防止电缆硬化、开裂和信号不稳定，从而提高电气可靠性。",
      "translation": "**Cold-resistant cabling**: The entire crane uses cold-resistant cables that remain flexible and maintain insulation performance in cold conditions, preventing cable hardening, cracking, and signal instability, thereby improving electrical reliability.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "025572213f4d": {
      "text": "**电机加热系统**：起升电机和行走电机均配备加热带，可在低温环境下进行预热和保温。",
      "translation": "**Motor heating system**: Both the hoisting and travel motors are fitted with heating tapes for preheating and heat retention in low-temperature environments.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "6ffe242d55ab": {
      "text": "这可防止启动困难和机械卡滞，确保稳定运行。",
      "translation": "This prevents hard starting and mechanical seizure, ensuring stable operation.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "444b5ccf957e": {
      "text": "**隔热驾驶室**：驾驶室隔热性能良好，并配备空调。",
      "translation": "**Insulated cabin**: The operator cabin offers good thermal insulation and is equipped with air conditioning.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "e92f90474797": {
      "text": "温度可根据环境条件自动调节，确保操作员舒适。",
      "translation": "The temperature adjusts automatically to ambient conditions, ensuring operator comfort.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "a7c69c5370f5": {
      "text": "为确保操作简便和本地兼容性，该系统针对俄罗斯市场进行了优化：",
      "translation": "To ensure ease of operation and local compatibility, the system was optimized for the Russian market:",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "19a1d0afc9dc": {
      "text": "**俄语标签**：视频监控系统和驾驶室控制台配备了英语和俄语双语标签，使当地操作员能够轻松识别功能和设备状态，降低误操作风险，提高维护效率。",
      "translation": "**Russian-language labeling**: The video monitoring system and cabin console are fitted with bilingual English and Russian labels, allowing local operators to easily identify functions and equipment status, reducing the risk of misoperation and improving maintenance efficiency.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "bc9fea510f30": {
      "text": "**本地电压兼容性**：该设备设计用于 380V / 50Hz / 3相电源，完全符合俄罗斯工业标准，确保直接安装和稳定运行。",
      "translation": "**Local voltage compatibility**: The equipment is designed for a 380V / 50Hz / 3-phase power supply, fully compliant with Russian industrial standards to ensure direct installation and stable operation.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "452001b5c77a": {
      "text": "配置了一套全面的安全保护系统，以确保安全稳定的运行：",
      "translation": "A comprehensive safety protection system was configured to ensure safe and stable operation:",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "f5f2b95f8be2": {
      "text": "**过载保护系统**：实时负载监控，具有多级报警和运动限制功能，以防止结构过载。",
      "translation": "**Overload protection system**: Real-time load monitoring with multi-level alarms and motion limiting to prevent structural overload.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "cad4f3e7a7b6": {
      "text": "**双重限位保护**：起升和行进限位开关，防止过行程和机械损坏。",
      "translation": "**Dual limit protection**: Hoisting and travel limit switches prevent over-travel and mechanical damage.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "728602d1dc34": {
      "text": "**紧急制动系统**：四个支腿上均设有紧急停止按钮，并具有系统范围内的紧急停止功能，可在紧急情况下快速关闭。",
      "translation": "**Emergency braking system**: Emergency-stop buttons are provided on all four legs, with a system-wide emergency-stop function for rapid shutdown in emergencies.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "ac3bd40569f6": {
      "text": "**防风系统**：风速传感器与轨道夹紧系统集成；当风速超过安全限值时，自动报警并锁定轨道，以防止滑移。",
      "translation": "**Anti-wind system**: Wind-speed sensors are integrated with a rail-clamping system; when wind speed exceeds the safe limit, it automatically alarms and locks onto the rail to prevent slippage.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "16d52e41e411": {
      "text": "**电气保护系统**：包括过电流、过温、缺相、相序错误、欠压和接地保护，以降低电气故障风险。",
      "translation": "**Electrical protection system**: Includes over-current, over-temperature, phase-loss, phase-sequence-error, under-voltage, and grounding protection to reduce the risk of electrical faults.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "fff855df9e7d": {
      "text": "考虑到运往俄罗斯的长途运输，关键部件都得到了特殊保护：",
      "translation": "Given the long-distance transport to Russia, all critical components were specially protected:",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "e13f80fe6267": {
      "text": "台车完全用防水布包裹，以防止雨水和潮湿造成的损坏。",
      "translation": "The trolley is fully wrapped in tarpaulin to prevent damage from rain and moisture.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "55be342110e5": {
      "text": "起升电机和变速箱电机用防震泡沫固定，以减少振动造成的损坏。",
      "translation": "The hoisting motor and gearbox motor are secured with shock-absorbing foam to reduce vibration damage.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "86b1c5515008": {
      "text": "行走机构的齿轮箱电机首先经过加固，并用防震泡沫固定，以确保运输过程中的稳定性。",
      "translation": "The travel mechanism's gearbox motor was first reinforced and secured with shock-absorbing foam to ensure stability during transport.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "f3c3547453a1": {
      "text": "然后，再覆盖一层防水篷布，以增强其防潮防雨性能。",
      "translation": "It was then covered with a layer of waterproof tarpaulin to enhance moisture and rain resistance.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "c73f625a7457": {
      "text": "绝缘操作室和电缆卷筒装在木箱中，以增强抗冲击性并防止运输过程中损坏。",
      "translation": "The insulated operator's cab and cable reel were packed in wooden crates to enhance impact resistance and prevent damage during transport.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "58ed661da711": {
      "text": "这样可以确保设备到达现场时的状态接近出厂交付状态。",
      "translation": "This ensures that the equipment arrives on site in a condition close to its factory-delivery state.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "fcb1bc398562": {
      "text": "交付的32吨轨道式集装箱龙门起重机成功满足了客户的所有关键要求：",
      "translation": "The delivered 32-ton Rail-Mounted Container Gantry Crane successfully met all of the customer's key requirements:",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "1660cad05bab": {
      "text": "在-40°C低温环境下稳定运行",
      "translation": "Stable operation in a -40°C low-temperature environment",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "fc1993843def": {
      "text": "完全符合俄罗斯当地电气和操作标准",
      "translation": "Full compliance with local Russian electrical and operating standards",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "c6de64d664d4": {
      "text": "综合户外安全防护系统",
      "translation": "Comprehensive outdoor safety protection system",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "c39476b0587a": {
      "text": "运输后关键部件状况良好，确保现场安装顺利进行。",
      "translation": "Critical components in good condition after transport, ensuring smooth on-site installation.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "3ca20a23e7cb": {
      "text": "该起重机根据项目要求进行了定制，具体规格如下：",
      "translation": "The crane was customized to the project requirements, with the following specifications:",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "010eab35e2d2": {
      "text": "**起重能力**：32吨（吊具下方）",
      "translation": "**Lifting capacity**: 32 tons (under the spreader)",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "36b7937cd58c": {
      "text": "**吊具**：40英尺集装箱吊具（支持旋转、平移、起吊和集装箱搬运作业）",
      "translation": "**Spreader**: 40 ft container spreader (supports rotation, translation, hoisting, and container-handling operations)",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "09526f75c45c": {
      "text": "**跨度**：20m",
      "translation": "**Span**: 20 m",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "bc91c646f109": {
      "text": "**提升高度**：10米（吊具下方）",
      "translation": "**Lifting height**: 10 m (under the spreader)",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "229947ce3077": {
      "text": "**负载等级**：ISO M6",
      "translation": "**Load class**: ISO M6",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "a92816e969af": {
      "text": "**工作温度**：-40°C 至 +40°C",
      "translation": "**Operating temperature**: -40°C to +40°C",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "62babc86d515": {
      "text": "**电源**：380V / 50Hz / 3相",
      "translation": "**Power Supply**: 380V / 50Hz / 3-phase",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "e3947d4e494f": {
      "text": "该项目在低温适应性、系统兼容性和运输可靠性方面均实现了统一的性能。",
      "translation": "The project achieved unified performance in low-temperature adaptability, system compatibility, and transport reliability.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "c01450144dba": {
      "text": "客户最初关注的所有关键风险均在设计和制造阶段得到解决，设备调试后运行稳定。",
      "translation": "All of the key risks the customer was initially concerned about were addressed during the design and manufacturing stages, and the equipment operated stably after commissioning.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "c04c73a601ed": {
      "text": "该项目的核心不仅仅是交付一台龙门起重机，而是为极寒环境提供一套完整可靠的集装箱搬运解决方案。",
      "translation": "The core of this project was not merely to deliver a gantry crane, but to provide a complete, reliable container-handling solution for an extremely cold environment.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "310a5689b02e": {
      "text": "通过选择低温材料、加强电气系统、局部设计和运输保护，该设备不仅\"技术上符合要求\"，而且\"在实际条件下长期可靠运行\"。",
      "translation": "By selecting low-temperature materials, reinforcing the electrical system, and applying localized design and transport protection, the equipment is not only \"technically compliant\" but also \"reliable in long-term operation under real-world conditions.\"",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "a54c055243f7": {
      "text": "DGCRANE 在起重机出口方面拥有超过 15 年的经验，并根据不同的工作条件和项目要求提供完全定制的解决方案和报价支持。",
      "translation": "DGCRANE has over 15 years of experience in crane exports and provides fully customized solutions and quotation support based on different working conditions and project requirements.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "dd674010348c": {
      "text": "我们的解决方案包括但不限于：",
      "translation": "Our solutions include but are not limited to:",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.353Z"
    },
    "c4581224d947": {
      "text": "桥式起重机、龙门起重机和悬臂起重机系统",
      "translation": "Overhead crane, gantry crane, and jib crane systems",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
