    },
    "32b3f16d102b": {
      "text": "结论",
      "translation": "Conclusion",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "ec9940618fe8": {
      "text": "导言",
      "translation": "Introduction",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "25665565b4d5": {
      "text": "在现代工业生产与物料搬运中，**5吨桥式起重机（5 Ton Overhead Crane）** 是应用最广泛的中型起重设备之一，广泛服务于机械制造、仓储物流、金属加工、矿山、造纸等行业。",
      "translation": "In modern industrial production and material handling, the **5 ton overhead crane** is one of the most widely used mid-capacity lifting machines, serving machinery manufacturing, warehousing and logistics, metal processing, mining, papermaking and many other industries.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "fc5dbc1cdf0d": {
      "text": "其兼具**适中起重量、灵活布置方式、结构成熟可靠**等优势，成为中小吨位吊装场景的首选。",
      "translation": "Combining **moderate lifting capacity, flexible configuration options and a mature, reliable structure**, it is the first choice for small-to-medium tonnage lifting scenarios.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "294410a0b19a": {
      "text": "根据不同厂房结构、吊装净空、使用频率和控制要求，5吨桥机可分为多种类型：从结构简洁的 LD 单梁桥机，到净空紧凑的低净空型、下悬式桥机，再到高性能的 FEM 欧式桥机与双梁桥机，满足不同行业和工况的需求。",
      "translation": "Depending on the building structure, lifting headroom, duty cycle and control requirements, 5 ton overhead cranes come in many types: from the structurally simple LD single girder crane, to compact low-headroom and underhung designs, up to high-performance FEM European-standard cranes and double girder cranes — covering the needs of different industries and working conditions.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "71ae94b90283": {
      "text": "本文深入探讨5吨桥式起重机的各种类型，从单梁到双梁设计，分析其价格影响因素，并通过参数对比和真实案例，展示如何选择最适合的设备。",
      "translation": "This article takes a deep dive into the various types of 5 ton overhead cranes, from single girder to double girder designs, analyzes the factors that drive their prices, and uses parameter comparisons and real project cases to show how to choose the best-fitting equipment.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "81d9b5a31fe0": {
      "text": "无论您是工程师、采购经理还是设施管理者，本指南都将为您提供全面的决策支持。",
      "translation": "Whether you are an engineer, a purchasing manager or a facility manager, this guide will give you comprehensive decision support.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "e4e46c7235d1": {
      "text": "类型",
      "translation": "Types",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "fd9f04de442f": {
      "text": "以下是常见的5吨桥式起重机类型，涵盖单梁和双梁设计，满足不同工业需求：",
      "translation": "Below are the common types of 5 ton overhead cranes, covering both single girder and double girder designs for different industrial needs:",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "ffc4e073f906": {
      "text": "**LD 单梁桥式起重机**——经济型单梁起重机，配备电动葫芦，适合轻型和中型物料搬运。",
      "translation": "**LD single girder overhead crane** — an economical single girder crane equipped with an electric hoist, suitable for light and medium material handling.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "6c408bddfc78": {
      "text": "特点：结构简单，成本低，安装方便，适用于标准车间。",
      "translation": "Features: simple structure, low cost, easy installation; ideal for standard workshops.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "1c89478d4a72": {
      "text": "**低净空单梁桥式起重机**——专为低净空车间设计，葫芦置于梁侧，增加起升高度。",
      "translation": "**Low headroom single girder overhead crane** — purpose-built for workshops with limited headroom; the hoist runs beside the girder to gain extra lifting height.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "020edef65012": {
      "text": "特点：节省垂直空间，降低建筑高度要求，适合空间受限环境。",
      "translation": "Features: saves vertical space and lowers the required building height; ideal for space-constrained environments.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "389da2ff9e35": {
      "text": "**下悬式单梁桥式起重机**——吊挂于车间屋顶轨道，适合无承重柱但屋顶可承重的场所。",
      "translation": "**Underhung (under-running) single girder overhead crane** — suspended from runway tracks fixed to the workshop roof, suitable for buildings without load-bearing columns but with a roof that can carry the load.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "9126a8bfb4f4": {
      "text": "特点：节省地面空间，适合小型工厂或仓库。",
      "translation": "Features: saves floor space; ideal for small plants or warehouses.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "0e38a0e35d23": {
      "text": "**FEM 单梁桥式起重机**——基于欧洲 FEM 标准设计，配备低净空电动葫芦，适合高精度任务。",
      "translation": "**FEM single girder overhead crane** — designed to the European FEM standard and fitted with a low-headroom electric hoist for high-precision tasks.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "829da9f1f051": {
      "text": "特点：轻量化、高刚性、节能，适合高要求车间。",
      "translation": "Features: lightweight, high rigidity, energy-saving; ideal for demanding workshops.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "00061f682878": {
      "text": "**偏置小车单梁桥式起重机**——葫芦小车偏置于主梁一侧，优化起升高度和空间利用。",
      "translation": "**Offset-trolley single girder overhead crane** — the hoist trolley is offset to one side of the main girder, optimizing lifting height and space utilization.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "6a223d405ae7": {
      "text": "特点：适合低净空和特殊布局车间，运行平稳。",
      "translation": "Features: suits low-headroom and special-layout workshops; smooth travelling.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "7bdd7fe19e2b": {
      "text": "**单轨起重机（Monorail Crane）**——沿单轨运行，适合直线或曲线物料搬运。",
      "translation": "**Monorail crane** — runs along a single rail for straight-line or curved material handling.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "ccd614bf0be6": {
      "text": "特点：结构紧凑，适合狭窄空间或特定生产线。",
      "translation": "Features: compact structure; ideal for narrow spaces or dedicated production lines.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "2c378970e5fd": {
      "text": "**欧洲上行式双梁桥式起重机（钢丝绳葫芦）**——基于欧洲标准，双梁设计配备葫芦小车或卷扬式小车。",
      "translation": "**European top running double girder overhead crane (wire rope hoist)** — European-standard double girder design carrying a hoist trolley or winch trolley.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "b397a9e4c808": {
      "text": "特点：结构紧凑、高效率、变频调速，适合高端工业应用。",
      "translation": "Features: compact structure, high efficiency, variable frequency speed control; ideal for high-end industrial applications.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "f821b4a94437": {
      "text": "**LH 型双梁桥式起重机（葫芦小车）**——双梁设计，配备葫芦小车，适合中型负载搬运。",
      "translation": "**LH type double girder overhead crane (hoist trolley)** — double girder design with a hoist trolley, suitable for medium-duty load handling.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "5c16691e0470": {
      "text": "特点：结构轻巧，高度较低，适用于工厂、矿山等。",
      "translation": "Features: light structure and low profile; used in factories, mines and similar sites.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "4a43fd521200": {
      "text": "**QD 型双梁桥式起重机（绞车小车）**——配备绞车小车，适合重型和频繁操作环境。",
      "translation": "**QD type double girder overhead crane (winch trolley)** — equipped with a winch trolley for heavy-duty, high-frequency operation.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "2012d8cdfdf3": {
      "text": "特点：高负载能力，稳定性强，适合钢厂、矿山等。",
      "translation": "Features: high load capacity and strong stability; ideal for steel mills, mines and other heavy industries.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "7314e23fc80a": {
      "text": "应用行业",
      "translation": "Applications",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "bdce3f1e4959": {
      "text": "5吨桥式起重机因其结构灵活、承载适中、操作便捷，在多个工业领域中扮演着关键角色，适用于日常搬运、精密装配与高频吊运等多种作业需求。",
      "translation": "Thanks to its flexible structure, moderate capacity and easy operation, the 5 ton overhead crane plays a key role across many industries, handling daily transfer, precision assembly and high-frequency lifting alike.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "42e366f9a2d3": {
      "text": "以下是其典型应用行业：",
      "translation": "Typical application industries include:",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "9d616545b48d": {
      "text": "**制造业**：用于原材料、半成品及零部件的搬运和定位，助力自动化产线高效运转，常见于汽车、家电、重工装备等工厂。",
      "translation": "**Manufacturing**: moving and positioning raw materials, semi-finished products and components to keep automated lines running efficiently — common in automotive, home appliance and heavy equipment plants.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "dce9faf19edd": {
      "text": "**仓储与物流**：在狭小或高架空间内实现货物的精确堆放与取出，提升空间利用率与装卸效率，适用于中型仓库、配送中心等。",
      "translation": "**Warehousing & logistics**: precise stacking and retrieval of goods in tight or high-rack spaces, improving space utilization and loading/unloading efficiency in mid-size warehouses and distribution centers.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "050dc0510986": {
      "text": "**机械加工车间**：用于重型工件的装卡、装配和机床上下料，提高操作安全性与生产精度，常配合数控加工设备使用。",
      "translation": "**Machining workshops**: clamping, assembling and loading/unloading heavy workpieces on machine tools, improving operating safety and production accuracy, often alongside CNC equipment.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "4b011684cd61": {
      "text": "**建筑与钢结构行业**：在钢筋加工区、预制构件厂、建筑等场所进行模板、钢板、构件吊装，提升施工效率。",
      "translation": "**Construction & steel structure industry**: hoisting formwork, steel plates and components in rebar processing areas, precast plants and construction sites to speed up the work.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "2bf809148906": {
      "text": "**石油化工**：用于大型阀门、管道设备等的吊装、测试与维护操作，常应用于防爆或耐腐蚀环境中。",
      "translation": "**Petrochemical industry**: lifting, testing and maintaining large valves, piping and equipment, often in explosion-proof or corrosion-resistant configurations.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "a4f94ea091f1": {
      "text": "**造纸与印刷**：在纸卷搬运、模切换装等环节进行高频起吊，尤其适合5吨以下的母卷或部件移动。",
      "translation": "**Papermaking & printing**: high-frequency lifting for paper roll handling and die-cut changeovers — especially suitable for moving master rolls or parts under 5 tons.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "ce0cbe869799": {
      "text": "**能源与电力行业**：支持变压器、断路器、母线等设备的组装与吊装，适用于发电站、变电站检修与运维场景。",
      "translation": "**Energy & power industry**: supporting the assembly and hoisting of transformers, circuit breakers, busbars and other equipment in power plants and substation maintenance scenarios.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "b70c2d28a16b": {
      "text": "价格",
      "translation": "Prices",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "a1da35d1adc3": {
      "text": "了解5吨桥式起重机的价格是选择合适设备的关键。",
      "translation": "Understanding 5 ton overhead crane prices is key to choosing the right equipment.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
    "9f2fd5f238cf": {
      "text": "价格因起重机类型、跨度、起升高度、工作环境和定制功能而异。",
      "translation": "Prices vary with crane type, span, lifting height, working environment and custom features.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.385Z"
    },
