    "579a3d39825f": {
      "text": "定制价格案例",
      "translation": "Customized price cases",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "2cd842d0001b": {
      "text": "**案例一：电磁桥式起重机**——类型：Electromagnetic overhead crane；起重量：5 吨；跨度：22.5 m；起升高度：20 m；起升速度：15.6 m/min；运行速度：大车 92.7 m/min、小车 37.2 m/min；工作级别：A6；控制方式：驾驶室控制；价格：$33,292。",
      "translation": "**Case 1: Electromagnetic overhead crane** — Type: Electromagnetic overhead crane; Capacity: 5 tons; Span: 22.5 m; Lifting height: 20 m; Lifting speed: 15.6 m/min; Travelling speed: crane 92.7 m/min, trolley 37.2 m/min; Duty class: A6; Control: cabin control; Price: $33,292.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "8d1d0ed657ba": {
      "text": "**案例二：欧洲上行式双梁桥式起重机（钢丝绳葫芦）**——类型：European top running double girder overhead crane with wire rope hoist；起重量：5 吨；跨度：16.5 m；起升高度：13 m；起升速度：0.5-5 m/min；运行速度：大车 4-40 m/min、小车 2-20 m/min；工作级别：A5；控制方式：遥控。",
      "translation": "**Case 2: European top running double girder overhead crane (wire rope hoist)** — Type: European top running double girder overhead crane with wire rope hoist; Capacity: 5 tons; Span: 16.5 m; Lifting height: 13 m; Lifting speed: 0.5-5 m/min; Travelling speed: crane 4-40 m/min, trolley 2-20 m/min; Duty class: A5; Control: remote control.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "22296b6d9b48": {
      "text": "价格：$19,143。",
      "translation": "Price: $19,143.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "2c64a7c56c0a": {
      "text": "**案例三：欧洲重型双梁桥式起重机（开式卷扬葫芦）**——类型：European heavy duty double girder overhead crane with open winch hoist；起重量：5 吨；跨度：25.5 m；起升高度：9 m；起升速度：0.88-8.8 m/min；运行速度：大车 5.8-58 m/min、小车 2.6-26 m/min；工作级别：A5；控制方式：驾驶室控制。",
      "translation": "**Case 3: European heavy duty double girder overhead crane (open winch hoist)** — Type: European heavy duty double girder overhead crane with open winch hoist; Capacity: 5 tons; Span: 25.5 m; Lifting height: 9 m; Lifting speed: 0.88-8.8 m/min; Travelling speed: crane 5.8-58 m/min, trolley 2.6-26 m/min; Duty class: A5; Control: cabin control.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "f3283ecb3eb1": {
      "text": "价格：$23,800。",
      "translation": "Price: $23,800.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "bfff71f6fc7a": {
      "text": "影响因素",
      "translation": "Price factors",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "adc6e7e8398e": {
      "text": "**起重能力与跨度**：更大跨度或特殊设计会显著增加成本。",
      "translation": "**Lifting capacity and span**: larger spans or special designs significantly increase the cost.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "f03a62114000": {
      "text": "**起升机构类型**：普通 CD/MD 电动葫芦价格较低，而欧标钢丝绳葫芦或开放式卷扬机则价格更高。",
      "translation": "**Hoisting mechanism type**: standard CD/MD electric hoists cost less, while European-standard wire rope hoists or open winches cost more.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "efa79e83daa0": {
      "text": "**工作环境要求**：如需防爆、防腐涂层或高温/湿热等特殊适应性设计，将增加附加费用。",
      "translation": "**Working environment requirements**: explosion-proof designs, anti-corrosion coatings, or adaptations for high temperature / humid environments add extra cost.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "9f967ad87040": {
      "text": "**控制系统配置**：如变频调速系统、无线遥控、智能监控等功能将提升整机售价。",
      "translation": "**Control system configuration**: variable frequency drives, wireless remote control, intelligent monitoring and similar features raise the overall price.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "ad81e3ffbbf6": {
      "text": "**定制参数建议**：建议在获取报价前向制造商明确提供关键参数，如起重量、跨度、起升高度、工作级别及使用环境，以便获得准确报价。",
      "translation": "**Custom parameter advice**: before requesting a quotation, give the manufacturer your key parameters — capacity, span, lifting height, duty class and operating environment — so you receive an accurate quote.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "21696a2e8dec": {
      "text": "类型对比",
      "translation": "Type comparison",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "9f6c2ff10342": {
      "text": "根据不同厂房结构、净空高度、使用频率及预算要求，5吨桥式起重机可细分为多种类型。",
      "translation": "Depending on building structure, headroom, duty cycle and budget, 5 ton overhead cranes can be broken down into several typical configurations.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "bbbfd3b80eca": {
      "text": "以下是几种典型结构的对比分析：",
      "translation": "Here is a comparison of the main ones:",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "b0e5acaba33a": {
      "text": "**普通单梁（LD 型） vs 低净空单梁（LDC 型）**：普通单梁桥机（LD 型）适用于标准车间，需要一定垂直净空以容纳主梁和电动葫芦的运行空间；低净空桥机（LDC 型）通过将葫芦设计为偏挂式或梁侧运行，有效降低整体设备高度，在相同起升高度下节省建筑高度，特别适用于净空受限的厂房或老旧厂房改造项目。",
      "translation": "**Standard single girder (LD type) vs low headroom single girder (LDC type)**: the standard LD single girder crane fits ordinary workshops but needs enough vertical clearance for the main girder and hoist to travel; the low headroom crane (LDC type) mounts the hoist offset or running beside the girder, cutting the overall equipment height — for the same lifting height it saves building height, making it ideal for headroom-limited plants and retrofit projects in older buildings.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "ed732654ae33": {
      "text": "**普通单梁（LD 型） vs 下悬式单梁（LX 型）**：普通单梁桥机为上运行结构，依赖地面立柱或侧梁进行轨道布置，适用于结构规则、有承重结构的标准厂房；下悬式桥机（LX 型）通过将轨道安装于屋顶或钢结构梁下、小车悬挂运行，可节省地面空间，适合无立柱结构或跨区吊装需求的车间。",
      "translation": "**Standard single girder (LD type) vs underhung single girder (LX type)**: the standard single girder crane is top-running and relies on floor columns or side rails for its runway, fitting regular workshops with load-bearing structures; the underhung crane (LX type) mounts its tracks under the roof or steel structure beams with the trolley suspended below, saving floor space — ideal for column-free buildings or cross-bay handling needs.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "3bd310974b24": {
      "text": "**传统设计 vs FEM 欧标设计**：传统单梁桥机多采用独立电机+减速箱结构，整体较重、维护频繁，适合常规搬运任务；FEM 标准单梁桥机采用三合一驱动系统（电机+减速机+制动器一体化），结构紧凑、启停平稳、后端盲区更小，同时配备免维护制动系统和高频率控制单元，能大幅降低运行噪音与长期维护成本。",
      "translation": "**Traditional design vs FEM European-standard design**: traditional single girder cranes mostly use a separate motor + gearbox arrangement — heavier overall and maintenance-intensive, fine for routine handling; FEM-standard single girder cranes use a three-in-one drive (motor + reducer + brake integrated), giving a compact structure, smooth starts and stops, smaller rear blind area, maintenance-free braking and high-frequency control — greatly reducing running noise and long-term maintenance cost.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "1ea4c147a172": {
      "text": "以下为5吨桥式起重机主要类型的参数与特点对比：",
      "translation": "Here is a side-by-side comparison of the main 5 ton overhead crane types:",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
