    },
    "8c18e9092f4a": {
      "text": "案例",
      "translation": "Cases",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "26c0d9662d45": {
      "text": "**5吨 FEM 单梁桥式起重机出口印度尼西亚**：最开始客户想自己生产主梁，我们提供其余配件。",
      "translation": "**5 ton FEM single girder overhead crane exported to Indonesia**: the customer initially planned to fabricate the main girder themselves while we supplied the remaining components.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "537ee7a2c349": {
      "text": "给客户报价后，客户的工程师又联系了我们，我们耐心解答了各种问题。",
      "translation": "After receiving our quotation, the customer's engineers came back with many questions, which we answered patiently.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "ea4d9cb814ed": {
      "text": "经过一个月的沟通，客户对我们的价格和产品很满意，一次采购了两台整机。",
      "translation": "After a month of communication, the customer was satisfied with our price and product and purchased two complete cranes in one order.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "28e2a46f5dad": {
      "text": "规格：起重量 3T&5T；型号 HD；跨度 9.15 m；起升高度 6 m；工作级别 A5；电源 380V/50Hz/3Ph；控制方式 手柄+遥控。",
      "translation": "Specifications: capacity 3T & 5T; model HD; span 9.15 m; lifting height 6 m; duty class A5; power supply 380V/50Hz/3Ph; control: pendant + remote control.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "a25213d511f3": {
      "text": "**5吨 FEM 桥式起重机出口埃塞俄比亚（27m 超长跨度定制方案）**：一位长期信赖的埃塞俄比亚客户介绍了新客户，我司成功交付一台 HD 型欧式单梁桥式起重机，起重量 5 吨。",
      "translation": "**5 ton FEM overhead crane exported to Ethiopia (27 m extra-long span customized solution)**: a long-trusted Ethiopian customer referred a new client, and we successfully delivered an HD type European single girder overhead crane with a capacity of 5 tons.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "e557085b6ce9": {
      "text": "前期沟通中，客户对 27.76 米超长跨度的主梁运输问题表示担忧。",
      "translation": "During the early discussions the customer was concerned about transporting the 27.76 m extra-long main girder.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "2b333cabeca1": {
      "text": "为此工程团队设计了分段方案：将主梁划分为三段（每段 11.8 米）分段运输，在安装现场通过高强度螺栓与法兰板连接拼装。",
      "translation": "Our engineering team designed a segmented solution: the girder was split into three sections (11.8 m each) for transport and joined on site with high-strength bolts and flange plates.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "6c49be537988": {
      "text": "为确保拼接处结构强度，进行了多项力学测试与现场连接检验，确保受力性能与整体主梁一致。",
      "translation": "To guarantee the strength of the joints, multiple mechanical tests and on-site connection inspections were carried out, ensuring the load behavior matches a one-piece girder.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "5d8057a8fd1c": {
      "text": "规格：起重量 5 吨；跨度 27.76 m；起升高度 10.5 m；起升速度 0.8/5 m/min；主要电气元件 施耐德；工作级别 FEM 2m；控制方式 手柄控制；电源 380V 50Hz 3Ph。",
      "translation": "Specifications: capacity 5 tons; span 27.76 m; lifting height 10.5 m; lifting speed 0.8/5 m/min; main electrical components Schneider; duty class FEM 2m; control: pendant control; power supply 380V 50Hz 3Ph.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "d2641b205b45": {
      "text": "**5吨低净空单梁桥式起重机出口菲律宾**：菲律宾客户计划在钢结构车间内进行钢板吊装作业。",
      "translation": "**5 ton low headroom single girder overhead crane exported to the Philippines**: the customer planned steel plate handling inside a steel-structure workshop.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "f89df6bdcdb9": {
      "text": "由于客户对起升高度有明确要求，但车间整体高度受限，我们为其选配了低净空单梁桥式起重机并配套低净空电动葫芦，在有限空间内有效提升了起吊高度。",
      "translation": "They had a clear lifting-height requirement but the building height was limited, so we configured a low headroom single girder overhead crane with a matching low-headroom electric hoist, effectively increasing the lifting height within the available space.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "e37df6236a66": {
      "text": "客户一次性订购了三台5吨低净空单梁桥式起重机。",
      "translation": "The customer ordered three 5 ton low headroom single girder overhead cranes at once.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "0320c01accda": {
      "text": "5吨桥式起重机作为现代工业生产中的核心设备，以适中的起重量、灵活的布置方式和成熟可靠的结构，成为机械制造、仓储物流、金属加工、矿山和造纸等行业的中流砥柱。",
      "translation": "As a core piece of equipment in modern industrial production, the 5 ton overhead crane — with its moderate capacity, flexible configuration and mature, reliable structure — is a mainstay of machinery manufacturing, warehousing and logistics, metal processing, mining and papermaking.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "d002aa44890a": {
      "text": "从经济实惠的 LD 单梁桥式起重机到高性能的 FEM 欧式桥机，再到适合重型任务的 QD 型双梁起重机，多种类型满足了不同厂房结构和工况需求。",
      "translation": "From the economical LD single girder crane to high-performance FEM European-style cranes and heavy-duty QD double girder cranes, the range of types covers different building structures and working conditions.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "4e74e5ba60c0": {
      "text": "本文通过详细的类型介绍、价格分析、参数对比以及真实案例，展示了如何根据跨度、起升高度、工作环境和控制要求选择最适合的起重机。",
      "translation": "Through detailed type introductions, price analysis, parameter comparison and real project cases, this article has shown how to choose the right crane based on span, lifting height, working environment and control requirements.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "e9422900d5a1": {
      "text": "无论是优化车间空间的低净空设计，还是应对恶劣环境的防爆双梁起重机，这些设备都为企业提供了高效、安全的物料搬运解决方案。",
      "translation": "Whether it is a low-headroom design that maximizes workshop space or an explosion-proof double girder crane for harsh environments, these machines give businesses an efficient and safe material handling solution.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
    "cbe13708e8c4": {
      "text": "如果您正在寻找一台可靠、耐用、高价值的5吨桥式起重机，请提供您的具体需求（如跨度、起升高度和工作等级），我们将为您提供定制化报价和专业建议。",
      "translation": "If you are looking for a reliable, durable, high-value 5 ton overhead crane, tell us your specific requirements (span, lifting height and duty class) and we will provide a customized quotation and professional advice.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "harvest",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T03:03:38.386Z"
    },
