    "cdef053908fa": {
      "text": "**5吨双梁桥式起重机出口沙特阿拉伯**：沙特一位长期客户对我们的产品和服务表示满意，再次采购了双梁桥式起重机、立柱式悬臂起重机和电动葫芦。",
      "translation": "**5-ton Double Girder Overhead Crane exported to Saudi Arabia**: A long-term Saudi customer, satisfied with our products and services, placed another order for Double Girder Overhead Crane, column-mounted Jib Crane, and Electric Hoist.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:35:40.633Z"
    },
    "a92603af9a98": {
      "text": "客户对设备的卓越品质和团队服务表示赞赏。",
      "translation": "The customer expressed appreciation for the excellent quality of the equipment and the team's service.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:35:40.633Z"
    },
    "4742f3111107": {
      "text": "规格：起重量 5 吨；跨度 16.98 m；起升高度 7 m；电机 ABM/SEW。",
      "translation": "Specifications: Lifting Capacity 5 tons; Span 16.98 m; Lifting Height 7 m; Motors ABM/SEW.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:35:40.633Z"
    },
    "a73e8ac5d75a": {
      "text": "起重机操作安全管理：核心标准、危险及风险预防 | DGCRANE",
      "translation": "Crane Operation Safety Management: Core Standards, Hazards, and Risk Prevention | DGCRANE",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.188Z"
    },
    "ace7501a89e6": {
      "text": "起重作业安全核心规范：典型事故案例警示、吊钩与钢丝绳使用报废标准、操作员标准化安全操作规程、“十不吊”安全禁令及标准指挥手势，全面防范起重作业安全风险。",
      "translation": "Core safety standards for lifting operations: warnings from typical accident cases, scrapping standards for hooks and wire ropes, standardized safety operating procedures for operators, the \"Ten No-Lift\" safety prohibitions, and standard command gestures, to comprehensively prevent safety risks in lifting operations.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.188Z"
    },
    "2061df2b6e92": {
      "text": "起重机操作安全管理：核心标准、危险及风险预防",
      "translation": "Crane Operation Safety Management: Core Standards, Hazards, and Risk Prevention",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.188Z"
    },
    "942ab3ba46fb": {
      "text": "起重作业事故警示与安全风险剖析",
      "translation": "Warnings from Lifting Accidents and Analysis of Safety Risks",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.188Z"
    },
    "0294b78e1d79": {
      "text": "典型事故案例警示",
      "translation": "Warnings from Typical Accident Cases",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.188Z"
    },
    "72b5c730db8e": {
      "text": "主要危害与事故成因",
      "translation": "Main Hazards and Accident Causes",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.188Z"
    },
    "f0846d4e5eb9": {
      "text": "核心吊具安全使用与报废标准",
      "translation": "Core Lifting Gear Safety Use and Scrapping Standards",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "80eb80514ff0": {
      "text": "1. 吊钩使用与报废要求",
      "translation": "1. Hook Use and Scrapping Requirements",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "560d5761e7c6": {
      "text": "2. 钢丝绳使用与报废要求",
      "translation": "2. Wire Rope Use and Scrapping Requirements",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "274663f0c983": {
      "text": "起重机操作员标准化安全操作规程",
      "translation": "Standardized Safety Operating Procedures for Crane Operators",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "f376c520d486": {
      "text": "1. 从业基本条件",
      "translation": "1. Basic Employment Conditions",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "fef175987295": {
      "text": "2. 作业核心要求",
      "translation": "2. Core Operating Requirements",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "239e65b83227": {
      "text": "3. 应急处置规范",
      "translation": "3. Emergency Response Standards",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "40962562b9f0": {
      "text": "“十不吊”安全禁令",
      "translation": "\"Ten No-Lift\" Safety Prohibitions",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "7fda95a14fbe": {
      "text": "标准指挥手势",
      "translation": "Standard Command Gestures",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "2d6f50d0ea84": {
      "text": "结语",
      "translation": "Conclusion",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "be9ce1787708": {
      "text": "起重作业作为工业生产、工程建设中的关键环节，作业流程复杂、安全风险突出，一旦出现操作违规、设备隐患、管理疏漏，极易引发吊物坠落、挤压碰撞、人员伤亡等安全事故，严重威胁生产安全与人员生命健康。",
      "translation": "As a critical link in industrial production and engineering construction, lifting operations involve complex processes and prominent safety risks. Any operational violations, equipment hazards, or management oversights can easily lead to accidents such as falling loads, crushing collisions, and casualties, seriously threatening production safety and the lives and health of personnel.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "f1d2ef86670a": {
      "text": "为全面强化起重作业安全管理，规范作业全流程操作，防范化解各类安全风险，现将起重作业安全核心规范、操作要求、风险防控要点整理如下，为安全生产提供坚实指引。",
      "translation": "To comprehensively strengthen safety management of lifting operations, standardize full-process operations, and prevent and mitigate various safety risks, the core safety standards, operational requirements, and key risk prevention points for lifting operations are summarized below, providing a solid guide for safe production.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "ab3edd2b29b9": {
      "text": "典型事故案例警示正文",
      "translation": "Warnings from Typical Accident Cases - Main Text",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "06af2d979abc": {
      "text": "历年来，因违规操作、设备隐患、管理缺失引发的起重作业事故频发，教训深刻：",
      "translation": "Over the years, frequent lifting accidents caused by violations, equipment hazards, and management deficiencies have occurred, with profound lessons:",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "56c40ee4c5e7": {
      "text": "2003 年大连某钢铁公司，因钢丝绳未检查、作业人员违规滞留危险区，起吊时钢丝绳断裂，热钢渣倾翻致作业人员死亡；",
      "translation": "In 2003, at a steel company in Dalian, due to failure to inspect the wire rope and operators illegally staying in the danger zone, the wire rope broke during lifting, and hot slag overturned, causing the death of an operator;",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "42a8f0f2252d": {
      "text": "2011 年铝加工企业，行车司机鲁莽操作引发行车相撞，作业人员险些高空坠落；同年度另一车间因行车工未升起吊带，违章行驶掀翻作业平台，所幸无人员伤亡；",
      "translation": "In 2011, at an aluminum processing enterprise, a crane driver's reckless operation caused a collision between cranes, and an operator narrowly escaped a fall from height; in the same year, in another workshop, a crane operator failed to raise the sling and illegally drove, overturning the work platform, fortunately without casualties;",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "cc9c3200a230": {
      "text": "2007 年温州某企业，无证人员违规操作起重机，无上升限位保护导致钢丝绳断裂、吊物下坠，造成人员死亡。",
      "translation": "In 2007, at an enterprise in Wenzhou, an unlicensed person illegally operated a crane without upper limit protection, causing the wire rope to break and the load to fall, resulting in a fatality.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "06ac84740c34": {
      "text": "主要危害与事故成因正文",
      "translation": "Main Hazards and Accident Causes - Main Text",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "4ec903f75bc7": {
      "text": "从事故统计数据来看，**吊物坠落（34%）、挤压碰撞（30%）** 是起重作业最高发的两类安全事故，同时还存在机体倾翻、物体打击、触电等多重风险。",
      "translation": "According to accident statistics, **falling loads (34%) and crushing collisions (30%)** are the two most frequent types of safety accidents in lifting operations, along with multiple risks such as overturning, object strikes, and electric shock.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "49d0c971f1e5": {
      "text": "起重伤害事故管理方面的原因：",
      "translation": "Management-related causes of lifting injury accidents:",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "dadb7cddfb49": {
      "text": "作业人员无证上岗，不是起重工、操作工的从事起重作业。",
      "translation": "Personnel work without proper certification, engaging in lifting operations without being qualified crane operators or riggers.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "92ed544cd3e5": {
      "text": "超载、抬吊等需要开具工作票的而未开。",
      "translation": "Work permits required for overload and tandem lifting are not issued.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "54179bd9953b": {
      "text": "安全交底未进行就进行作业。",
      "translation": "Operations are carried out without safety briefing.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "8a743efe8c8b": {
      "text": "安全措施落实不到位。",
      "translation": "Safety measures are not fully implemented.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "09b0e1f10a46": {
      "text": "起重设备未做试验或试验不合格就投运。",
      "translation": "Lifting equipment is put into operation without testing or after failing tests.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "1e9d1fad382d": {
      "text": "起重伤害事故的直接原因：",
      "translation": "Direct causes of crane injury accidents:",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "e308cd96abff": {
      "text": "起重机在吊运物体时，无专人或不熟悉指挥信号，物体下降过快，造成脱钩。",
      "translation": "When the crane is lifting objects, if there is no dedicated person or the signal is unfamiliar, and the object descends too fast, it can cause the hook to disengage.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "b959a1cd061f": {
      "text": "钢丝绳没有定期检查，吊运物体受力过大而造成断裂伤人。",
      "translation": "Wire ropes are not inspected regularly, and excessive force on the lifted object can cause breakage and injury.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "6f8c7c5fd931": {
      "text": "由于吊挂钩时不当，使物体不稳定产生晃动，碰到堆物或撞击周围人员。",
      "translation": "Improper hooking or rigging causes the object to be unstable and sway, hitting stacked materials or striking nearby personnel.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "db43f86dc8e6": {
      "text": "对作业环境危险源认识不足，造成在吊件的惯性移动过程中，挤压碰撞人。",
      "translation": "Insufficient awareness of hazards in the work environment leads to crushing or collision during the inertial movement of the lifted load.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "abc4793be7b5": {
      "text": "由于吊装方法不对，捆绑不牢固，导致吊件坠落，地面人员遭受伤害。",
      "translation": "Incorrect lifting methods and insecure fastening cause the load to fall, injuring personnel on the ground.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "d760da19d127": {
      "text": "由于对吊物重量估算不准，负荷超重，造成起重机刹车失灵。",
      "translation": "Inaccurate estimation of load weight and overloading cause the crane brake to fail.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "785fdd5ac21f": {
      "text": "作业人员缺乏起重知识，技能低下，违章操作。",
      "translation": "Operators lack lifting knowledge, have low skills, and violate operating procedures.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "a1f317899318": {
      "text": "多工种协同施工的作业面，缺乏统一指挥，作业人员之间配合不当，造成吊件作业过程中伤害作业人员。",
      "translation": "On multi-trade collaborative work surfaces, lack of unified command and poor coordination among operators cause injuries during lifting operations.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "d4b57f438e03": {
      "text": "起重机工具等设备只管使用，不管维护保养而带病使用，起重机械故障造成起重事故。",
      "translation": "Crane tools and equipment are used without maintenance, operating while defective, leading to crane failures and accidents.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "d0c8d4a57814": {
      "text": "由于起重作业人员选用的钢丝绳、链条、卸卡等吊索具的不当，安全系数不足或没有，造成吊物坠落伤人、设备损坏。",
      "translation": "Improper selection of wire ropes, chains, shackles, and other rigging by lifting personnel, with insufficient or no safety factors, causes falling loads to injure people and damage equipment.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "b3c9391a00b4": {
      "text": "吊钩使用与报废要求正文",
      "translation": "Hook Usage and Scrapping Requirements",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "e994a0730541": {
      "text": "吊钩是起重作业的核心受力部件，其完好性直接决定作业安全，必须严格执行使用与报废规范。",
      "translation": "The hook is the core load-bearing component in lifting operations; its integrity directly determines operational safety, and strict compliance with usage and scrapping specifications is mandatory.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "61f311d602c5": {
      "text": "**使用规范**：不使用铸造吊钩，吊钩需固定牢固、转动灵活，表面无裂纹、无损伤缺陷，缺陷严禁补焊；必须配备防意外脱钩安全装置，确保锁紧螺母、固定螺栓等配件完好。",
      "translation": "**Usage Specifications**: Do not use cast hooks; hooks must be securely fixed, rotate flexibly, have no cracks or defects on the surface, and defects must not be repaired by welding; safety devices to prevent accidental unhooking must be provided, ensuring locking nuts, fixing bolts, and other accessories are intact.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "cd702b6d3c3d": {
      "text": "**报废标准**：出现裂纹（裂纹不能焊补）、危险断面磨损超 10%、开口度增加超 15%、钩身扭转变形超 10°、塑性变形等情况，必须立即报废；片钩衬套、心轴磨损超标需及时更换。",
      "translation": "**Scrapping Standards**: Immediately scrap if cracks appear (cracks cannot be welded), wear on the dangerous section exceeds 10%, opening increase exceeds 15%, hook body torsional deformation exceeds 10°, or plastic deformation occurs; replace laminated hook bushings and pins if wear exceeds limits.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "d4e5f47d8aee": {
      "text": "钢丝绳使用与报废要求正文",
      "translation": "Wire Rope Usage and Scrapping Requirements",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "7456c6e922b4": {
      "text": "钢丝绳是起重作业的核心受力部件之一，承载能力强、运行平稳、可靠性高，但刚性较大，易受磨损、高温、腐蚀影响，使用不当易断裂引发事故。",
      "translation": "Wire rope is one of the core load-bearing components in lifting operations, with strong load capacity, smooth operation, and high reliability, but it is relatively rigid and susceptible to wear, high temperature, and corrosion; improper use can cause breakage and accidents.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "e505683f54bf": {
      "text": "**报废情形**：出现波浪形、钢丝/绳股挤出、笼状变形、绳径异常、弯折、扭结、局部压扁等畸形状态，需立即报废。",
      "translation": "**Scrapping Conditions**: Immediately scrap if wavy shape, wire/strand extrusion, cage-like deformation, abnormal rope diameter, bending, kinking, local flattening, or other deformed states occur.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "18f851dbe238": {
      "text": "从业基本条件正文",
      "translation": "Basic Employment Requirements",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "fdf8a85ad169": {
      "text": "作为起重作业核心操作人员，必须持证上岗、依规操作，严守全流程安全规范。",
      "translation": "As core lifting operators, one must hold a valid certificate, operate according to regulations, and strictly follow all safety procedures throughout the process.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "e7688e75eea1": {
      "text": "行车工必须通过专业培训考核，并持有效操作证者方能操作行车，未经专门训练和考试不得单独操作。",
      "translation": "Crane operators must pass professional training and assessment and hold a valid operation certificate before operating the crane; those without special training and examination are not allowed to operate independently.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "e7e8fdaa3c01": {
      "text": "行车工必须年满 18 周岁，身体健康，无妨碍从事本职工作的疾病和生理缺陷（如色盲、近视听觉障碍、癫痫病、高血压、心脏病、眩晕症、精神病和突发性昏厥症等）。",
      "translation": "Crane operators must be at least 18 years old, in good health, and free from diseases or physical defects that hinder their work (such as color blindness, hearing impairment, epilepsy, hypertension, heart disease, vertigo, mental illness, and sudden fainting disorders).",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "e4bf84a583b2": {
      "text": "应具有对起重机全部机构及装置的性能和用途、电气知识及防火知识。",
      "translation": "They should have knowledge of the performance and uses of all crane mechanisms and devices, electrical knowledge, and fire prevention knowledge.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "2b789d7514b3": {
      "text": "行车工操作时不准吸烟、吃东西、看书报、打手机等，应严格遵守劳动纪律。",
      "translation": "During operation, crane operators are not allowed to smoke, eat, read books or newspapers, use mobile phones, etc., and must strictly observe labor discipline.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "c8e88e563171": {
      "text": "熟悉各种指挥信号。",
      "translation": "Be familiar with various command signals.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "5616163064cd": {
      "text": "作业核心要求正文",
      "translation": "Core Operational Requirements",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "5896ee0cbbb6": {
      "text": "操作需遵循**稳、准、快、安全、合理**五大原则，启动制动平稳、吊物停靠精准、高效作业、杜绝事故、合理操控设备。",
      "translation": "Operation must follow the five principles of **stability, accuracy, speed, safety, and rationality**, with smooth start and braking, precise load positioning, efficient operation, accident prevention, and reasonable equipment control.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "d3f28f21c0fd": {
      "text": "**作业前**：规范穿戴劳保用品，穿绝缘鞋、着“三紧”工作服；经专用梯子上下驾驶室，做好设备交接班检查与空车试运转，确认无异常方可作业。",
      "translation": "**Before Operation**: Wear protective equipment properly, wear insulated shoes and a 'three-tight' work suit; enter and exit the cab via the dedicated ladder, conduct shift handover inspections and no-load trial runs, and confirm no abnormalities before starting work.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "e84dae4e39d4": {
      "text": "**作业中**：启动、靠近设备、起吊落吊、经过人员区域时鸣铃警示；逐级调速，严禁直接换向、越档、歪拉斜吊；吊物需高于途经设备 0.5 米，落吊确认稳妥后脱钩；禁止吊物悬空长时间停留，作业中严禁检修、上下设备。",
      "translation": "**During operation**: Sound the horn as a warning when starting, approaching equipment, lifting/lowering loads, or passing through personnel areas; adjust speed step by step, and strictly prohibit direct reversal, gear skipping, or skewed lifting; the load must be kept 0.5 meters above any equipment in the path, and only release the hook after confirming the load is securely landed; do not leave loads suspended for extended periods, and strictly prohibit maintenance or getting on/off the equipment during operation.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "4f0b886da607": {
      "text": "**作业后**：将设备停至指定位置，升起吊钩、手柄回零、切断电源，完成设备清扫与润滑保养。",
      "translation": "**After operation**: Park the equipment at the designated position, raise the hook, return the pendant control to zero, cut off the power supply, and complete equipment cleaning and lubrication maintenance.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "90f3eff676c2": {
      "text": "应急处置规范正文",
      "translation": "Emergency Response Procedures",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "988f882ffe30": {
      "text": "**制动器失效**：保持冷静，反复慢速升降吊物，鸣铃警示，将吊物移至空旷区域安全落地，严防设备断电。",
      "translation": "**Brake failure**: Stay calm, repeatedly raise and lower the load slowly, sound the horn as a warning, move the load to an open area and land it safely, and strictly prevent equipment power loss.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "52fc20d7e3bc": {
      "text": "**电气火灾**：立即切断电源，使用干粉、二氧化碳灭火器灭火，严禁带电用水扑救。",
      "translation": "**Electrical fire**: Immediately cut off the power supply, use dry powder or carbon dioxide fire extinguishers to put out the fire, and strictly prohibit using water to extinguish while energized.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "d8790e209fab": {
      "text": "“十不吊”安全禁令正文",
      "translation": "Ten No-Lift Safety Prohibitions",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "f8626e4d2d8e": {
      "text": "起重作业必须严格执行“十不吊”刚性要求，任何情况下不得违规起吊：",
      "translation": "Lifting operations must strictly comply with the rigid requirements of the \"Ten No-Lift\" rules, and no lifting is allowed under any circumstances in violation of these rules:",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "cf2a2470f547": {
      "text": "超重、超负荷不吊；",
      "translation": "Do not lift if overweight or overloaded;",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "d3482effc8b0": {
      "text": "指挥信号不明、违章指挥不吊；",
      "translation": "Do not lift if the command signal is unclear or if the command violates regulations;",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "5bc44e15fe4a": {
      "text": "吊物捆绑不牢、不符合安全要求不吊；",
      "translation": "Do not lift if the load is not securely fastened or does not meet safety requirements;",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "09cb4756fcc1": {
      "text": "光线昏暗、视线不清不吊；",
      "translation": "Do not lift if the lighting is dim or visibility is poor;",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "b73b46b4cc03": {
      "text": "歪拉斜挂工件不吊；",
      "translation": "Do not lift if the load is pulled at an angle or hung obliquely;",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "685ed3944fbc": {
      "text": "吊物上站人、放置浮置物不吊；",
      "translation": "Do not lift if there are people standing on the load or floating objects placed on it;",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "05ca5fbc8c70": {
      "text": "安全装置不全、失灵不灵敏不吊；",
      "translation": "Do not lift if safety devices are incomplete, malfunctioning, or not sensitive;",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "964c2c48942a": {
      "text": "带棱角、缺口物体无防割措施不吊；",
      "translation": "Do not lift if objects with sharp edges or notches lack anti-cutting measures;",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "5958fbef3e38": {
      "text": "吊物吨位不清不吊；",
      "translation": "Do not lift if the tonnage of the load is unclear;",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "1d2224a7c085": {
      "text": "埋地物件、与建筑物/设备钩挂不吊。",
      "translation": "Do not lift buried objects or objects hooked to buildings/equipment.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "c428a2302d8d": {
      "text": "标准指挥手势正文",
      "translation": "Standard Command Gestures",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "560d119ab4d0": {
      "text": "规范统一的指挥手势是起重作业安全的重要保障，作业人员与指挥人员须共同熟记以下核心指挥手势，确保信号传递准确无误。",
      "translation": "Standardized and unified command gestures are an important guarantee for the safety of lifting operations. Operators and signal persons must jointly memorize the following core command gestures to ensure accurate signal transmission.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "74d720dbb84f": {
      "text": "安全是生产的底线，规范是安全的保障。",
      "translation": "Safety is the bottom line of production, and standardization is the guarantee of safety.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "b069047b74d5": {
      "text": "起重作业事关人员生命与企业生产稳定，各作业岗位需牢固树立安全意识，严格遵守吊具使用、操作流程、安全禁令等各项规范，强化设备维护、细化现场管理、杜绝违章行为，全面筑牢起重作业安全防线，以规范操作守护生产全程平安。",
      "translation": "Lifting operations concern the safety of personnel and the stability of enterprise production. All work positions must firmly establish safety awareness, strictly comply with all regulations on lifting tools, operating procedures, and safety prohibitions, strengthen equipment maintenance, refine on-site management, eliminate violations, comprehensively build a solid safety defense line for lifting operations, and safeguard the entire production process with standardized operations.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:13.189Z"
    },
    "dea9d0ee2fdb": {
