      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "d8bacb666037": {
      "text": "定制龙门起重机",
      "translation": "Custom Gantry Crane",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "482bb16f7889": {
      "text": "龙门起重机是工业生产和建筑工程中的重要设备，在物料搬运和重物吊装中发挥着关键作用。",
      "translation": "Gantry cranes are essential equipment in industrial production and construction engineering, playing a key role in material handling and heavy lifting.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "ddba70b7569a": {
      "text": "作为专业的起重机制造商，DGCRANE 提供多种龙门起重机，涵盖单梁、双梁、半龙门和便携式等类型，能够满足从轻型车间应用到大型港口作业的多样化需求。",
      "translation": "As a professional crane manufacturer, DGCRANE offers a variety of gantry cranes, including Single Girder, Double Girder, Semi-gantry, and Portable types, capable of meeting diverse needs from light workshop applications to large port operations.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "d142a6287e92": {
      "text": "本文将对价格区间、隐性成本、采购流程和预算方案进行全面分析，帮助您做出明智的采购决策。",
      "translation": "This article provides a comprehensive analysis of price ranges, hidden costs, procurement processes, and budget plans to help you make informed purchasing decisions.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "f19010b58121": {
      "text": "市场概览引言",
      "translation": "Market Overview Introduction",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "8a4490d34251": {
      "text": "龙门起重机凭借其灵活性和适应性，广泛应用于工业生产、物流运输和建筑领域。",
      "translation": "Gantry cranes, with their flexibility and adaptability, are widely used in industrial production, logistics, and construction fields.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "1982967a712f": {
      "text": "不同类型的龙门起重机适用于不同的场景和工况，用户应根据自身具体需求进行选型。",
      "translation": "Different types of gantry cranes are suitable for different scenarios and working conditions; users should select based on their specific needs.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "b10255fdbf30": {
      "text": "市场概览小结",
      "translation": "Market Overview Summary",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "70ee2c811b8f": {
      "text": "通过这些差异化设计，DGCRANE 龙门起重机不仅能满足多样化的应用需求，还能帮助企业提升整体生产效率、确保更安全的物料搬运。",
      "translation": "Through these differentiated designs, DGCRANE gantry cranes not only meet diverse application needs but also help enterprises improve overall production efficiency and ensure safer material handling.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "36477784ff2f": {
      "text": "单梁龙门起重机正文",
      "translation": "Single Girder Gantry Crane Content",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "60ae49f31b48": {
      "text": "单梁龙门起重机是一种轨道式中小型起重设备，主要由门架（含主梁、支腿和下横梁）、起升机构、运行机构和电气控制系统组成。",
      "translation": "Single Girder Gantry Crane is a rail-mounted medium and small lifting equipment, mainly composed of the gantry frame (including Main Girder, legs, and bottom crossbeam), hoisting mechanism, traveling mechanism, and electrical control system.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "8bc16851e695": {
      "text": "它采用电动葫芦作为起升机构，运行时沿工字钢主梁的下翼缘行走。",
      "translation": "It uses an Electric Hoist as the hoisting mechanism and travels along the lower flange of the I-beam Main Girder during operation.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "e64cc3f6ee67": {
      "text": "门架结构可为箱型或桁架型：箱型结构工艺性好、易于制造，桁架结构则更轻、抗风性更强。",
      "translation": "The gantry frame can be of box-type or truss-type: the box-type structure has good manufacturability and is easy to fabricate, while the truss structure is lighter and more wind-resistant.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "3ac3227d0cc2": {
      "text": "整机自重轻、结构简单、安装维护方便，适用于工厂、矿山、货场和仓库等室外区域中小起重量的常规装卸作业。",
      "translation": "The whole machine is lightweight, simple in structure, and easy to install and maintain, suitable for conventional loading and unloading operations of small and medium Lifting Capacity in outdoor areas such as factories, mines, freight yards, and warehouses.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "2a39fd943853": {
      "text": "以下为单梁龙门起重机（MH 系列）的价格参考：",
      "translation": "The following is a price reference for Single Girder Gantry Crane (MH series):",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "0132ce7298ec": {
      "text": "型号",
