    "5f4e66ec8a46": {
      "text": "成本引言",
      "translation": "Cost Introduction",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "e9aa01cb72d3": {
      "text": "龙门起重机的成本不仅限于设备报价，还包括若干相关支出。",
      "translation": "The cost of a gantry crane is not limited to the equipment quote, but also includes several related expenses.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "3f076a929b50": {
      "text": "主要影响因素如下。",
      "translation": "The main influencing factors are as follows.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "80f68fb7b4aa": {
      "text": "设备本体正文",
      "translation": "Equipment Body",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "be9f1f4393e3": {
      "text": "设备本身是主要的成本构成，包括主梁、支腿、运行机构和起升机构（电动葫芦/小车）。",
      "translation": "The equipment itself is the main cost component, including the main girder, legs, travel mechanism, and hoisting mechanism (electric hoist/trolley).",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "65ec8b51ca53": {
      "text": "龙门起重机价格因规格和结构设计而差异巨大。",
      "translation": "Gantry crane prices vary greatly depending on specifications and structural design.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "5e50b3129086": {
      "text": "跨度、起升高度、起重量和工作级别等参数都直接影响最终成本。",
      "translation": "Parameters such as span, lifting height, lifting capacity, and duty class directly affect the final cost.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "867f000f4c22": {
      "text": "**起重量**：从几吨到数百吨不等。",
      "translation": "**Lifting Capacity**: Ranging from a few tons to hundreds of tons.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "98d75c7a3070": {
      "text": "吨位越高，制造成本和售价越高。",
      "translation": "Higher tonnage leads to higher manufacturing costs and selling prices.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "465eab4603d4": {
      "text": "**跨度与高度**：更大的跨度和更高的起升高度需要更多钢材和更复杂的设计，从而推高价格。",
      "translation": "**Span and Height**: Larger spans and higher lifting heights require more steel and more complex designs, thus driving up the price.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "6c7c8ef63664": {
      "text": "**结构形式**：单梁起重机在中轻载荷下通常更经济，双梁起重机承载能力和稳定性更强，因而更昂贵。",
      "translation": "**Structural Form**: Single girder cranes are generally more economical under light to medium loads, while double girder cranes offer greater load capacity and stability, making them more expensive.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "9fc6c0ff5683": {
      "text": "特殊设计正文",
      "translation": "Special Design",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "25b495c4ed3c": {
      "text": "当起重机必须在复杂工况下运行时，需要特殊设计和材料选择。",
      "translation": "When the crane must operate under complex working conditions, special design and material selection are required.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "599acbbbf901": {
      "text": "高温、低温、沿海、洁净室或防爆等环境会显著增加制造和设计成本。",
      "translation": "Environments such as high temperature, low temperature, coastal, cleanroom, or explosion-proof significantly increase manufacturing and design costs.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "347c4336d8c0": {
      "text": "运输成本正文",
      "translation": "Transportation Cost",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "edf66bc223db": {
      "text": "龙门起重机是大型机械设备，通常以集装箱运输。",
      "translation": "Gantry cranes are large mechanical equipment, usually transported in containers.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "047966d6fc81": {
      "text": "集装箱一般为 20 英尺或 40 英尺，部分超大部件须作为散货运输。",
      "translation": "Containers are typically 20 or 40 feet, and some oversized components must be shipped as bulk cargo.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "51872950c953": {
      "text": "运输成本由船公司和货代根据运价、货物体积重量、贸易条款（FOB/CIF）和集装箱类型（FCL/LCL）确定：",
      "translation": "Shipping costs are determined by shipping companies and freight forwarders based on freight rates, cargo volume and weight, trade terms (FOB/CIF), and container type (FCL/LCL):",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "b9519d727808": {
      "text": "**整箱（FCL）**：包含当地港杂费、码头操作费（THC）、文件费、铅封费、提箱费、加固、报关、舱单、VGM 及录入费。",
      "translation": "**Full Container Load (FCL)**: Includes local port charges, terminal handling charges (THC), documentation fees, seal fees, container pickup fees, lashing, customs declaration, manifest, VGM, and entry fees.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "f6f877821987": {
      "text": "适合批量订单，单位运费更低。",
      "translation": "Suitable for bulk orders, with lower unit freight costs.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "778abd19bed2": {
      "text": "**拼箱（LCL）**：包含当地港杂费、报关、舱单、VGM 及录入费。",
      "translation": "**Less than Container Load (LCL)**: Includes local port charges, customs declaration, manifest, VGM, and entry fees.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "befaf64fe579": {
      "text": "适合小批量货物。",
      "translation": "Suitable for small shipments.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "1a0be7c6267a": {
      "text": "**散货**：用于超大或超重部件，按货物尺寸报价。",
      "translation": "**Bulk Cargo**: Used for oversized or overweight components, quoted based on cargo dimensions.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "f8be822eecf1": {
      "text": "**保险与关税**：按货物申报价值的一定比例收取。",
      "translation": "**Insurance and Duties**: Charged as a percentage of the declared value of the goods.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "9374a9893292": {
      "text": "安装成本正文",
      "translation": "Installation Cost",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "7438d626bfe2": {
      "text": "安装是影响总成本的另一关键因素。",
      "translation": "Installation is another key factor affecting total cost.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "1b5b616547d6": {
      "text": "DGCRANE 提供灵活的安装方案：",
      "translation": "DGCRANE offers flexible installation options:",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "d7d724381162": {
      "text": "免费提供详细的安装视频和远程指导。",
      "translation": "Detailed installation videos and remote guidance are provided free of charge.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "11e0d0f609c8": {
      "text": "工程师现场安装，费用涵盖签证、往返机票、餐饮、住宿、人身保险，以及每人每天 **180–200 美元** 的日薪。",
      "translation": "On-site installation by engineers covers visa, round-trip airfare, meals, accommodation, personal insurance, and a daily rate of **$180–200** per person per day.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "b6298ec7b689": {
      "text": "综上，龙门起重机成本主要受结构参数、特殊设计、运输方式和安装服务四个方面影响。",
      "translation": "In summary, the cost of a Gantry Crane is mainly influenced by four aspects: structural parameters, special designs, transportation methods, and installation services.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "38a883398537": {
      "text": "理解这些因素有助于企业有效平衡性能与预算。",
      "translation": "Understanding these factors helps enterprises effectively balance performance and budget.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "967cf12e1a2b": {
      "text": "智能选购建议正文",
      "translation": "Smart Purchasing Advice",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "d1d1976b5720": {
      "text": "面对众多在售龙门起重机，如何自信地选对一台？",
      "translation": "With so many Gantry Cranes on the market, how can you confidently choose the right one?",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "67742bee4384": {
      "text": "以下是几条实用的选购建议。",
      "translation": "Here are some practical purchasing tips.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "d9e15bd2b494": {
      "text": "**明确技术需求**",
      "translation": "**Clarify Technical Requirements**",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "18377bd6f784": {
      "text": "起重量、跨度、高度和使用频率等关键参数决定型号与价格。",
      "translation": "Key parameters such as Lifting Capacity, Span, height, and frequency of use determine the model and price.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "87b5e14b3b2d": {
      "text": "防爆、防腐、洁净室或户外等特殊工况需要定制考虑。",
      "translation": "Special working conditions such as Explosion-proof, Anti-corrosion, cleanroom, or outdoor use require customized considerations.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "b96bfa340f19": {
      "text": "DGCRANE 提供标准和定制两种设计，确保与您的工作环境精确匹配。",
      "translation": "DGCRANE offers both standard and customized designs to ensure a precise match with your working environment.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "8d37e43cb7c2": {
      "text": "**选择可靠的制造商**",
      "translation": "**Choose a Reliable Manufacturer**",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "0d966338b7dd": {
      "text": "优先选择具备国际资质认证的供应商，以确保产品质量和按期交付。",
      "translation": "Prioritize suppliers with international certifications to ensure product quality and on-time delivery.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "4ef6c16b7265": {
      "text": "DGCRANE 通过 ISO 和 CE 认证，拥有丰富的出口经验，服务全球 **90 多个国家**。",
      "translation": "DGCRANE is ISO and CE certified, with extensive export experience, serving **over 90 countries** worldwide.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "a63ae38fe606": {
      "text": "**考虑全生命周期成本**",
      "translation": "**Consider Total Lifecycle Cost**",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "16e0723372ef": {
      "text": "不要只看初始价格，还要考虑长期运行、维护和能耗。",
      "translation": "Don't just look at the initial price; also consider long-term operation, maintenance, and energy consumption.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "89836b65687a": {
      "text": "DGCRANE 专注于节能耐用的结构，延长使用寿命、降低维护成本。",
      "translation": "DGCRANE focuses on energy-efficient and durable structures to extend service life and reduce maintenance costs.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "bfe97f31dc52": {
      "text": "**售后服务保障**",
      "translation": "**After-Sales Service Support**",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "bdb6c1bb9095": {
      "text": "确保供应商提供远程支持、备件供应和现场协助。",
      "translation": "Ensure the supplier provides remote support, spare parts supply, and on-site assistance.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "0879e4d190c0": {
      "text": "DGCRANE 提供远程技术支持、备件供应以及本地安装调试服务。",
      "translation": "DGCRANE provides remote technical support, spare parts supply, and local installation and commissioning services.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "cf5c69e0a668": {
      "text": "结论正文",
      "translation": "Conclusion",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "99b2f0edc312": {
      "text": "龙门起重机在提升生产效率、保障作业安全方面发挥着重要作用，广泛应用于工厂、仓库、建筑工地和港口。",
      "translation": "Gantry cranes play a vital role in improving production efficiency and ensuring operational safety, and are widely used in factories, warehouses, construction sites, and ports.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "7ff130d98c7f": {
      "text": "从价格与成本分析，到采购流程和经济型方案，企业都需要综合评估性能、工况、预算和长期维护。",
      "translation": "From price and cost analysis to procurement processes and economical solutions, enterprises need to comprehensively evaluate performance, working conditions, budget, and long-term maintenance.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "2b770525c9c7": {
      "text": "作为全球领先的起重机制造商，DGCRANE 提供种类齐全的龙门起重机，包括单梁、双梁、半龙门、便携式和定制方案。",
      "translation": "As a globally leading crane manufacturer, DGCRANE offers a full range of gantry cranes, including single girder, double girder, semi-gantry, portable, and customized solutions.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "bec0e7e85419": {
      "text": "凭借透明的报价、高效的交付和强大的售后支持，DGCRANE 是您值得信赖的高品质、高性价比起重解决方案合作伙伴。",
      "translation": "With transparent pricing, efficient delivery, and strong after-sales support, DGCRANE is your trusted partner for high-quality, cost-effective lifting solutions.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "485b86937707": {
      "text": "如果您正在寻找一台**可靠、耐用、高价值的龙门起重机**，DGCRANE 就是您可以依靠的伙伴。",
      "translation": "If you are looking for a **reliable, durable, and high-value gantry crane**, DGCRANE is the partner you can rely on.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:36:45.814Z"
    },
    "3eaa65aec7cd": {
      "text": "独立式旋臂起重机 - DGCRANE",
      "translation": "Free-standing Jib Crane - DGCRANE",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "human",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:44:34.947Z"
    },
    "e914b676ed03": {
      "text": "独立式（自由站立式）旋臂起重机制造商与出口商，容量高达16吨、臂长高达16米、旋转120-360°，结构轻巧、占地小、易安装，适用于短距离密集作业单元。",
      "translation": "Free-standing (self-standing) jib crane manufacturer and exporter, with lifting capacity up to 16 tons, boom length up to 16 meters, rotation 120-360°, compact structure, small footprint, easy installation, suitable for short-distance intensive work cells.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "human",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:44:34.947Z"
    },
    "43cbd397f45e": {
      "text": "独立式旋臂起重机",
      "translation": "Freestanding Jib Crane",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "human",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:44:34.947Z"
    },
    "074eb2096190": {
