    },
    "994ef9d891f7": {
      "text": "建立信任确实很难，但凭借我们10多年的销售经验和所做的3000多个项目，终端用户和代理商都从我们的合作中获得并受益。",
      "translation": "Building trust is indeed difficult, but with our 10+ years of sales experience and over 3000 projects completed, both end users and agents have benefited from our cooperation.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.276Z"
    },
    "5baf52dd0de6": {
      "text": "顺便说一下，独立销售代表的招聘。",
      "translation": "By the way, recruitment of independent sales representatives.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.276Z"
    },
    "7c094692ba41": {
      "text": "丰厚的佣金/无风险。",
      "translation": "Generous commission / No risk.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.276Z"
    },
    "7afa579920b0": {
      "text": "欧式环链电动葫芦结构紧凑，性能可靠。模块化设计使我们的产品可以灵活地组成不同的起重吨位、起重速度和工作等级系统。优异的性能满足了货物快速转移和精密装配的要求，也可广泛应用于使用要求复杂的场所，满足客户的个性化需求。",
      "translation": "The European electric chain hoist is compact and reliable. Its modular design lets our products flexibly form systems with different lifting capacities, lifting speeds, and duty classifications. The outstanding performance meets the demands of fast cargo transfer and precision assembly, and it can also be widely used in workplaces with complex requirements to meet customers individualized needs.",
      "status": "approved",
      "origin": "human",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:46:58.580Z"
    },
    "8e966422f380": {
      "text": "欧式桥式起重机是在欧洲先进的设计和制造技术的基础上，结合国内最新标准自主开发设计的。",
      "translation": "The European-style Overhead Crane is independently developed and designed based on advanced European design and manufacturing technology, combined with the latest domestic standards.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.276Z"
    },
    "af1560300a79": {
      "text": "外观漂亮，传动机构采用三合一减速器（硬齿面减速器、变频制动电机），在外观和技术性能上完全可以与欧洲同类产品媲美。",
      "translation": "With an attractive appearance, the transmission mechanism adopts a three-in-one reducer (hardened gear reducer, variable frequency braking motor), fully comparable to similar European products in appearance and technical performance.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.276Z"
    },
    "fa9ac37fec36": {
      "text": "欧式桥式起重机广泛用于机械制造、石油、石化、港口、铁路、民航、电力、食品、造纸、建材、电子等行业的车间和仓库等物料搬运场合。",
      "translation": "European-style Overhead Cranes are widely used for material handling in workshops and warehouses in industries such as machinery manufacturing, petroleum, petrochemical, ports, railways, civil aviation, power, food, papermaking, building materials, and electronics.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.276Z"
    },
    "0f5a46f5bd47": {
      "text": "它们特别适用于需要精确定位的材料处理、大型部件的精密装配等场合。",
      "translation": "They are particularly suitable for material handling requiring precise positioning and precision assembly of large components.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.276Z"
    },
    "da77303b7f60": {
      "text": "其优越性能体现在模块化设计、变频调速、自动检测等先进技术的成熟应用。",
      "translation": "Its superior performance is reflected in the mature application of advanced technologies such as modular design, variable frequency speed control, and automatic detection.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.276Z"
    },
    "d03319b2d391": {
      "text": "过载保护、过流保护、失压保护等完善的保护功能使起重机的应用和工作性能更加完善。",
      "translation": "Comprehensive protection functions such as overload protection, overcurrent protection, and undervoltage protection further enhance the application and working performance of the crane.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.276Z"
    },
    "cd39446f6b88": {
      "text": "结构紧凑",
      "translation": "Compact structure",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.276Z"
    },
    "8f1ac76cfd5f": {
      "text": "良好的刚度",
      "translation": "Good rigidity",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.276Z"
    },
    "4e2b9b33d8bb": {
      "text": "节省厂房空间和投资成本",
      "translation": "Saves workshop space and investment costs",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.276Z"
    },
    "8071b158960b": {
      "text": "美丽的外观",
      "translation": "Beautiful appearance",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.276Z"
    },
    "815f0fe9358b": {
      "text": "变频器：变频器的保护功能可以对各驱动机构进行短路、过流、电机过热、欠压、过压、接地、短路、防失速、散热器过热、制动单元过热保护。",
      "translation": "Variable Frequency Drive: The protection functions of the VFD can provide short-circuit, overcurrent, motor overheating, undervoltage, overvoltage, grounding, short-circuit, anti-stall, heatsink overheating, and braking unit overheating protection for each drive mechanism.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "d3347ef837b9": {
      "text": "配电保护。",
      "translation": "Power distribution protection.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "02b0da7d1d40": {
      "text": "起重机配电的主回路装有保护部件，如主电源的自动空气开关和主接触器。",
      "translation": "The main circuit of the crane's power distribution is equipped with protective components, such as an automatic air switch for the main power supply and a main contactor.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "c41ec6bfe3a9": {
      "text": "短路保护。",
      "translation": "Short-circuit protection.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "3aa481bd95dc": {
      "text": "主电源电路装有自动开关作为起重机的短路保护；控制电路装有小容量自动空气开关作为短路保护。",
      "translation": "The main Power Supply circuit is equipped with an automatic switch for short-circuit protection of the crane; the control circuit is equipped with a small-capacity automatic air switch for short-circuit protection.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "23ed4bedba70": {
      "text": "过载保护。",
      "translation": "Overload protection.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "72df849f163d": {
      "text": "起重机各机构的电机均装有单独的过流保护装置作为过载保护；主电源的自动空气开关作为起重机的过载保护。",
      "translation": "Each motor of the crane's mechanisms is equipped with an individual overcurrent protection device as overload protection; the main Power Supply automatic air switch serves as the crane's overload protection.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "b78bb97b8d1d": {
      "text": "相序保护。",
      "translation": "Phase sequence protection.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "7ed7bcd6f4a7": {
      "text": "设备采用相序保护器，实时监控电源质量。",
      "translation": "The equipment adopts a phase sequence protector to monitor Power Supply quality in real time.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "bf43c31dd8af": {
      "text": "当电源因外界原因产生过压、欠压、缺相或相序变化时，控制系统将切断主回路，有效保护设备和人员的安全。",
      "translation": "When the power supply experiences overvoltage, undervoltage, phase loss, or phase sequence changes due to external reasons, the control system will cut off the main circuit, effectively protecting the safety of equipment and personnel.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "f1d41a9dbcd0": {
      "text": "升降机限位保护。",
      "translation": "Hoist limit protection.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "4561c49ee4e4": {
      "text": "升降机构配备了就位限位开关和限位开关。",
      "translation": "The hoisting mechanism is equipped with a positioning limit switch and a limit switch.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "eb186aa43ea0": {
      "text": "就位限位开关可确保升降机构在就位时自动停止。",
      "translation": "The positioning limit switch ensures that the hoisting mechanism automatically stops when in position.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "364b672a6480": {
      "text": "限位开关可以确保升降机构在吊钩上升到极限位置时自动切断。",
      "translation": "The limit switch ensures that the hoisting mechanism automatically cuts off when the hook rises to the extreme position.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "2e2aa9d5475b": {
      "text": "行走限位保护。",
      "translation": "Travel limit protection.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "5e4474c9ccbc": {
      "text": "起重机行进和小车横移机构一般都装有在位限位开关和两端的限位开关。",
      "translation": "The crane travel and trolley traverse mechanisms are generally equipped with positioning limit switches and limit switches at both ends.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.276Z"
    },
    "f910880e4c4b": {
      "text": "紧急断电保护。",
      "translation": "Emergency power-off protection.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "c8ddf964b7e7": {
      "text": "起重机的控制电路上装有紧急开关。",
      "translation": "An emergency switch is installed on the control circuit of the crane.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "fdb8eaebdd25": {
      "text": "当事故发生时，可随时切断控制电路的电源，然后切断主电路，保证起重机的安全运行。",
      "translation": "In case of an accident, the Power Supply to the control circuit can be cut off at any time, and then the main circuit is disconnected to ensure the safe operation of the crane.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "afd7d64bf156": {
      "text": "防腐、防尘和密封措施。",
      "translation": "Anti-corrosion, dust-proof, and sealing measures.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "e57c3dd95ee0": {
      "text": "桥式起重机广泛应用于仓库和工厂，是一种重要的材料处理设备。",
      "translation": "Overhead Cranes are widely used in warehouses and factories, serving as important material handling equipment.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "76cd70722842": {
      "text": "虽然，不同的国家和地区有自己的特点。",
      "translation": "However, different countries and regions have their own characteristics.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "17d8af71cfe6": {
      "text": "在中国，最初的桥式起重机和制造技术是源于前苏联的。",
      "translation": "In China, the initial Overhead Cranes and manufacturing technology originated from the former Soviet Union.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "7b43f79c43d0": {
      "text": "经过几十年的发展，桥式起重机已经像现在一样，在中国几乎所有的领域都得到了应用，这已经证明了它的优良特性。",
      "translation": "After decades of development, Overhead Cranes have been applied in almost all fields in China as they are now, which has proven their excellent characteristics.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "7681c55bc2a7": {
      "text": "因此，如果你来自俄罗斯，这对你来说将是非常熟悉的。",
      "translation": "Therefore, if you come from Russia, this will be very familiar to you.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "b3b867dd93b9": {
      "text": "其他方面，如果你来自欧洲和美国地区，情况就不同了。",
      "translation": "On the other hand, if you come from Europe and the United States, the situation is different.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "01c96e1d87b6": {
      "text": "接下来，让我们谈谈欧式桥式起重机的销售。",
      "translation": "Next, let's talk about the sales of European-style Overhead Cranes.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "770eaf1427b7": {
      "text": "说实话，出售的桥式起重机在世界范围内使用得比较广泛，当然，中国除外。",
      "translation": "To be honest, the Overhead Cranes sold are widely used worldwide, except in China, of course.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "52bd4a4b2367": {
      "text": "它们之间在外观和技术标准上有很多不同。",
      "translation": "There are many differences in appearance and technical standards between them.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "6dcd845c6183": {
      "text": "而随着技术的发展和交流，差别越来越小，特别是双梁桥式起重机。",
      "translation": "With the development and exchange of technology, the differences are getting smaller, especially for Double Girder Overhead Cranes.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "4ceffb67be1d": {
      "text": "现在，主要的区别是在单梁桥式起重机和安装式钢丝绳电动葫芦。",
      "translation": "Now, the main difference lies in the Single Girder Overhead Crane and the installed Wire-rope Electric Hoist.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "ac51d26e2e27": {
      "text": "正如以下图片所示。",
      "translation": "As shown in the following pictures.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "46804c7abfed": {
      "text": "横梁",
      "translation": "Cross beam",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "cf341b29cb00": {
      "text": "横梁 - 欧式单梁桥式起重机销售是H型钢结构，而传统的单梁桥式起重机是焊接的箱型。",
      "translation": "Cross beam - The European-style Single Girder Overhead Crane for sale uses H-beam steel structure, while traditional Single Girder Overhead Cranes use welded box-type.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "2557d0942f22": {
      "text": "欧洲型的重量较轻。",
      "translation": "The European type is lighter in weight.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "a0ec4069c8c7": {
      "text": "终端卡车--终端卡车没有大的区别。",
      "translation": "End carriage - There is no significant difference in end carriages.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "7e30b6cb6b20": {
      "text": "吊装比较",
      "translation": "Hoisting comparison",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "cb0da80b7a18": {
      "text": "葫芦--另一个主要区别是葫芦，欧洲型葫芦更先进，有更高的提升高度。",
      "translation": "Hoist - Another major difference is the hoist; the European-type hoist is more advanced with a higher lifting height.",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
    "194f1ab9e98c": {
      "text": "简要技术参数比较",
      "translation": "Brief Technical Parameter Comparison",
      "status": "draft",
      "origin": "engine",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T08:38:11.277Z"
    },
